    <p>
      CIIE schedules, visitor procedures and Chinese immigration policies can change. Verify current official information before relying on any registration deadline, entry exemption or transportation arrangement.
    </p>

    <p>
      Meeting published visa-free transit requirements does not guarantee admission. Chinese immigration authorities make the final entry decision.
